{"id":"n5-034","title":"Noun に します (Noun ni shimasu)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Express a choice or decision; 'choose', 'decide on'.","longExplanation":"The に します grammar point is used to express making a choice or decision. It can be translated as 'choose' or 'decide on' in English. It is often used in situations where someone has to make a selection or decide on something, such as ordering food at a restaurant or deciding on a vacation destination.","formation":"Noun + に します","examples":[{"jp":"今日の昼ご飯は寿司にします。","romaji":"Kyou no hirugohan wa sushi ni shimasu.","en":"I'll choose sushi for today's lunch.","words":[{"surface":"今日","vocabId":"1579110","reading":"きょう"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"昼","vocabId":"1426250","reading":"ひる"},{"surface":"ご飯","vocabId":"1270590","reading":"ごはん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"寿司","vocabId":"1595650","reading":"すし"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7,8]},{"jp":"この靴を買うか迷っていますが、赤い色の方にします。","romaji":"Kono kutsu wo kau ka mayotteimasu ga, akai iro no hou ni shimasu.","en":"I was hesitating about which shoes to buy, but I'll go with the red ones.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"靴","vocabId":"1246700","reading":"くつ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"買う","vocabId":"1473740","reading":"かう"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"迷っ","vocabId":"1532710","reading":"まよう","baseForm":"迷う"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"赤い","vocabId":"1383240","reading":"あかい"},{"surface":"色","vocabId":"1357600","reading":"いろ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"方","vocabId":"1516930","reading":"ほう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720"